      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "10",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Mawe gangī ga shilagīlo",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 10:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ī likanza lyenīlo ū SEEBA ūniwīla, “Beejaga mabalala gangī abīlī ga mawe gītī a ga kwandya, hanuma wize hangī ū kūlī nene ū kū lūgūlū; ūbeeje n'isandīko lya mbawa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.10.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.10.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 10:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nakūyandīka hangī ha mabalala ī mihayo īyo yalī a ha mabalala a ga kwandya, ayo wagabelagūlile. Hūna ūkūgatūūla ū ng'wisandīko. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.10.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.10.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 10:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Na lūūlū nūbeeja isandīko lya mbawa ja ng'wininga, hūna nūbeeja mabalala gangī abīlī ga mawe, ūmo gaalī a ga kwandya. Nūlinha ū mu lūgūlū nagabūkije a mabalala ga mawe būbīlī wago mu makono gane. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.10.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.10.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 10:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū SEEBA wandīka a ha mabalala ga mawe genaya ī mihayo īyo walī wayandīka ī kwandya, a malange ikūmi ga shilagīlo ayo walī wamuwīla aho akayomba ning'we mu lūgūlū kūfuma mu moto, ū mu lūshikū ūlo ng'walī ng'wibilinga. Hūna ū SEEBA ūninha a mabalala genayo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.10.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.10.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 10:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hanuma ya henaho nika kūfuma ū mu lūgūlū, a mabalala genayo nūgatūūla ū ng'wisandīko īlo naalī naabeeja, gīt'ūmo SEEBA akanilagīīlīla; h'ūmo galī nī haha. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.10.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.10.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 10:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "A Baisilaeli būshimīza kūfuma Be-eloti Benejakani,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.10.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.10.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "f",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10:6",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "Be-eloti Benejakani:",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "Nūūlū; Nzwinzī ja Benejakani.",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " kūshisha Mosela. Ū Alooni ūzumalīkīla kwenūko, ūjīkwa; Elieza ng'witūnja wakwe wingīla a ha nīmo gwa būgabīji būtaale a ha ng'wanya gwakwe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.10.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.10.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 10:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū kūfuma a henaho būshimīza kūshisha būshika Gudigoda, būlūmbūlīla kūshisha Yotibatani, sī ya mahululu ga minzī. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.10.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.10.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 10:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ī likanza lyenīlo ū SEEBA ūbakomanya a banhū ba lūganda lwa Lawī kūlwa nīmo gwa kūlībūūcha ī lisandīko ly'ilagane lya ng'wa SEEBA, kwīmīīla kū būtongi bo ng'wa SEEBA kūlwa būtūmami, na kūbafuuha a banhū mu lina lyakwe, gīt'ūmo bataalī bakwītīlaga kūshisha lelo īyī. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.10.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.10.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 10:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hī nguno yene a Balawī batī na ngabo nūūlū wingīji ū mu baana ba ng'wabo; ū SEEBA hū ng'wene ūyo alī wingīji wabo, gīt'ūmo SEEBA Mulungu wing'we akabawīlīla. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.10.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.10.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 10:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nakikala ū mu lūgūlū shikū makūmi anè līīmi na būjikū gīt'ūmo naalī nīītīla ū lūgendo ū lwa kwandya. Nū lūkangala lwenūlū ū SEEBA ūniigwa hangī, nguno jalī jitī ng'hūmbū jakwe ū kūmukenaagūla.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.10.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.10.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 10:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hūna ū SEEBA ūniwīla, “Būūkaga ūje kūjūbatongeela a banhū ū mu lūgendo lwabo, baje bakīdime ībize yabo ī sī īyo nabilahīlīla bakūlūgenji babo gīkī nakūbinha.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.10.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.10.11"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Kūng'ogoha SEEBA",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 10:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.10.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.10.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 10:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Alilūūlū bebe Isilaeli, ū SEEBA Mulungu wako atogilwe kī ū kūfuma ū kūlī bebe, ūlū ītī kūng'ogoha SEEBA Mulungu wako, kūshimīzīla mu nzīla jakwe jose, kūntogwa we, na kūntūmamīla SEEBA Mulungu wako na ng'holò yako yose na būpanga wako bose; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.10.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.10.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 10:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "kūshimīzīla mu kahelele na malange gakwe ayo nalīkwinha lelo īyī kūlwa solobo yako? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.10.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.10.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 10:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Managa gīkī ī ligūlū līlī lya ng'wa SEEBA Mulungu wako, na a mapandī ga ng'wigūlū ayo galī higūlya no no no; pyī nī sī hamò nī shose īsho shilīmo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.10.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.10.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 10:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Alīyo ū SEEBA akabalolegeja būtogwa wakwe a bakūlūgenji bako, ūbatogwa hūna ūmusola a bing'we ba shibyalīlwe shabo, ūmutogwa kūtinda pye a banhū ba mahanga a gangī gīt'ūmo īlī lelo īyī. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.10.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.10.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 10:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Na lūūlū jisaalagi ī ng'holò jing'we, nī mitwe ying'we yaya ū kwikala midiimu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.10.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.10.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 10:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nguno ū SEEBA Mulungu wing'we alī Mulungu wa bamulungu na Seeba wa baseeba; hū ng'wene ū Mulungu ū ntaale, wa būdūla na wa lyogohya, ūyo atasolanhyaga banhū nūūlū atanukūlaga būhongwa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.10.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.10.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 10:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Akabalwīlīīlaga a bapīna na a bachīlwa; nū ngeni akandīlīlaga na kūng'winha shilīwa na shizwalo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.10.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.10.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 10:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Na a bing'we shing'wigeleelilwe kūbatogwa a balobeji ba mu sī ying'we; nguno na a bing'we ng'walī balobeji ū mu sī ya Misili. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.10.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.10.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 10:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ng'ogohagi ū SEEBA Mulungu wing'we, na muntūmamīle we; dimanagi nang'hwe gwa, nū mu kwilahīla kwing'we ng'wilahīla mu lina lyakwe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.10.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.10.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 10:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hū ng'wene shiigelile munkumīlīje, ū wei alī Mulungu wing'we ūyo akīīta mihayo mitaale ya kūkamaaja na ya kogohya kūlwa nguno ying'we, īyo mukībona na miso ging'we. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.10.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.10.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 10:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "A bakūlūgenji bing'we abo bakaja mu sī ya Misili baalī banhū makūmi mpungtī dūhū; alīyo ī haha ū SEEBA Mulungu wing'we wang'wītile kwibyalana na kūkwīla gītī sonda ja ng'wigūlū.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.10.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.10.22"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
